<p>
Complex numbers can be stored in their rectangular form, with a real
and an imaginary part. They can also be stored in polar form, where there&rsquo;s a
magnitude and an angle. Whichever way a complex number is stored, we would like
to be able to query it for all of these four quantities:
</p>



<ul class="org-ul">
<li>The real coordinate in the rectangular form of the complex number.</li>
<li>The imaginary coordinate in the rectangular form.</li>
<li>The magnitude in the polar form.</li>
<li>The angle in the polar form.</li>
</ul>


